    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MIRANDA: Can I get some assistance here? Hello?!\nMIRANDA: Irene?! Anybody!?\nMIRANDA: Wake up, wake up... You're dreaming. It's not real. An anxiety dream, that's all. That's all. This is dream logic. If it was real, they woul…\nMIRANDA: I'm just dreaming.",
      "MIRANDA: I don't -- I think I'm alright.\nIRENE: You go in last because you're special. It's not a Mexican prison, toots. Everybody here minds their own business.\nMIRANDA: If it's all the same, I'd rather --\nIRENE: State law says we keep you ladies clean. And I'm a stickler for the law. Now come on. If you go downtown, you gotta dance.",
      "MIRANDA: Shelley?\nSHELLEY: And pick up those damn cigarette butts. Jesus, TV is dumb --\nMIRANDA: Shelley, can you do me a favor??\nSHELLEY: The housewives will find something better to do.",
      "IRENE: Hey! Chloe!\nCHLOE: You fucking cow giving me the evil eye, huh? Fuck you, you fuckin' voodoo witch -- !\nCONSUELO: Is okay, she's okay -- she don't mean nothing.\nCHLOE: You bet your goddamn fat ass I mean it, you're a witch -- !!",
      "IRENE: How are we feeling today?\nMIRANDA: 'We'?\nIRENE: Sorry I asked.\nMIRANDA: Doesn't seem like the best choice of words when treating schizophrenics."
    ]
  },
